    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A DARK STRATEGY FOR SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghouls &amp; Guardians, humanity clings to sacred ground, fending off waves of corrupted creatures that stalk the night. As the last line of defense, you must build, manage, and adapt \u2014 or be overrun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic RTS and tower defense experiences, this game blends medieval dark fantasy, resource management, and strategic tower synergy into an intense tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.poster.avif?t=1749668497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.webm?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.mp4?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD, GATHER, DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f Harvest wood, stone, and iron to expand your defenses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Deploy towers and barracks in real-time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Combine elemental damage types to trigger powerful condition effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire \u2192 Burnt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice \u2192 Frozen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic \u2192 Enchanted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate synergies to deal bonus damage and turn the tide against the ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/eff82102b12eafb4fd45475dda156c98.poster.avif?t=1749668497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/eff82102b12eafb4fd45475dda156c98.webm?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/eff82102b12eafb4fd45475dda156c98.mp4?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE THE HORDE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The temple must stand \u2014 but it won\u2019t be easy. Ghouls come in many forms, from swarming minions to monstrous threats like the Boomwight, which explodes on death and destroys weakened towers nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Defend workers and guardians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26cf\ufe0f Lose your economy, and you lose the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Survive up to 50 waves of escalating attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/5948ce3c95cef3340d5c19d06e823751.poster.avif?t=1749668497\" width=658 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/5948ce3c95cef3340d5c19d06e823751.webm?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/5948ce3c95cef3340d5c19d06e823751.mp4?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEW CHALLENGES EACH RUN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its evolving maps, unlockable skills, and strategic choices, Ghouls &amp; Guardians offers replayable gameplay that rewards smart combinations and bold decisions. Whether you're placing your first tower or pushing back the 50th wave, every match is a test of wit and will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Can you hold the line when the night comes?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A DARK STRATEGY FOR SURVIVAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ghouls &amp; Guardians, humanity clings to sacred ground, fending off waves of corrupted creatures that stalk the night. As the last line of defense, you must build, manage, and adapt \u2014 or be overrun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic RTS and tower defense experiences, this game blends medieval dark fantasy, resource management, and strategic tower synergy into an intense tactical challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.poster.avif?t=1749668497\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.webm?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533690/extras/c87bffa99fb9185c4098d71f384695e5.mp4?t=1749668497\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD, GATHER, DEFEND</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f Harvest wood, stone, and iron to expand your defenses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Deploy towers and barracks in real-time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Combine elemental damage types to trigger powerful condition effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire \u2192 Burnt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ice \u2192 Frozen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic \u2192 Enchanted</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate synergies to deal bonus damage and turn the tide against the ghouls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop